            "intro_bio": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Melissa Quintero is a Colombian contemporary artist based in Miami. Born in Barranquilla, Colombia, she was raised in Atlanta before returning to Colombia at the age of fourteen. She later earned her degree in architecture in Bogotá and spent fourteen years practicing architecture in Bogotá and Florida, including six years with a luxury residential firm in Palm Beach. In 2026, she left architecture to dedicate herself fully to her artistic practice.</p>",
